Monitor
  status      Show UPS status
  battery     Show battery charge and runtime…
  events      Show UPS event history
Act
  beeper      Show or change the UPS beeper
  notify      Send or inspect UPS notifications
Set up
  init        Plan or apply NUT configuration
  rollback    List or restore a configuration…
  config      Inspect, scaffold, render, or diff…
Prove
  doctor      Check UPS protection and recovery…
  bios        Guide and verify BIOS recovery…
  drill       Guide and record a physical outage…
Shell
  completion  Install, inspect, or remove shell…
